+
+### Process-local shell selection
+
+Set `MCODE_SHELL_PATH` to an existing absolute shell executable before starting the CLI to override the platform default. The shared shell resolver applies the same choice to foreground/background Bash operations and environment descriptions. Invalid paths fail without falling back. ACP initialize reports `_meta["minimax-code/shell"]` with version 1, executable, arguments, and shell type when this override is present. This setting changes the command interpreter only; it does not change permissions, approval decisions, or sandbox policy.
